  "solution": "The logic followed here is,\n\n**5: 27**\n\n→ 27 = (5)² + 2\n\n→ 27 = 25 + 2\n\n**7: 51**\n\n→ 51 = (7)2 + 2\n\n→ 51 = 49 + 2\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**9: ?**\n\n→ ? = (9)2 + 2\n\n→ ? = 81 + 2 = 83\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"83\"**.",
